# App Store screenshots — generated by .github/workflows/screenshots.yml.
# Live output should come from a clean CI run, not a developer's laptop;
# the workflow uploads the canonical bundle as the `app-store-screenshots`
# artifact for manual upload to ASC. The leading slash anchors this to the
# repo root so it doesn't accidentally match scripts/screenshots/ (source).
/screenshots/


